Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.08,0:01:52.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Wang Lin, have a principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.68,0:01:55.44,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1604,465)}Purple Division\NHeavenly Fate Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:54.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,If one doesn't mess with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:56.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't mess with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.00,0:01:58.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if someone dares to mess with me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.80,0:02:00.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will destroy them !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.72,0:02:09.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,You disrespectful brat !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:11.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare you act recklessly
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:13.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,on this joyous day of our Heavenly Fate Sect !?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.24,0:02:14.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Earth Shard !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.04,0:02:41.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've provoked me twice now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:44.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I don't kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:46.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am not Wang Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:51.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Demonic flames  !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:52.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,What ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.56,0:02:53.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,How is this possible ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.36,0:02:56.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Seventh Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.60,0:02:58.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is Master’s birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.32,0:02:59.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are many fellow cultivators here !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:01.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't act recklessly !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.52,0:03:03.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Outsiders of the Heavenly Fate Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:05.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,will not interfere
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.04,0:03:07.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,in this internal strife.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.40,0:03:09.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Seventh Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:10.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,sit down !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.60,0:03:11.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,The competition
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:12.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,isn't today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:14.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don't get to decide
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.88,0:03:16.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,whether we do it today
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.92,0:03:18.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,or not !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:24.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Heaven and Earth Mantra of Freedom !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.80,0:03:44.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Master's birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.40,0:03:46.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't dare to kill me !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.24,0:03:47.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,You won't kill me !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:55.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:57.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,you dared to kill a direct disciple !?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.48,0:04:02.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's too bold !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.40,0:04:03.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Indeed...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.24,0:04:06.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's your turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.20,0:04:09.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin broke the sect rules
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.40,0:04:10.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,by killing a disciple !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:12.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where are the Disciplinary Elders ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.20,0:04:16.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whoever stands in my way
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:18.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,is my enemy !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.04,0:04:20.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.68,0:04:25.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,You guys !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:30.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fourth Sister !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:33.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I already repaid
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.64,0:04:35.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,the favor I owed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.00,0:04:37.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Give me a good reason
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.52,0:04:38.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,to intervene.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.64,0:04:45.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fine !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.60,0:04:46.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fine !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.40,0:05:34.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wanted to save this for the competition...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:36.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we will
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:38.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,settle this now with a fight to the death !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.60,0:05:48.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master actually planted a demon seed inside him !?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.48,0:05:49.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's unfair !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:14.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is bad !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.12,0:06:38.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is that !?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:55.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,God Slaying Chariot,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.28,0:06:57.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,activate !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:08.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop this at once !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.60,0:07:26.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,What are you even fighting for ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.28,0:07:28.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,You didn't even let me finish my wine...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.00,0:07:31.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greetings
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.40,0:07:32.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uncle Chi Lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.36,0:07:35.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Calling me Uncle won't save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:38.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You forcefully used the demon seed before it was ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.44,0:07:39.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your Master said
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.08,0:07:42.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,that you are banned from participating
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.20,0:07:43.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.16,0:07:46.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:47.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Impossible !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.12,0:07:49.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I cultivated 1000 years for this !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.44,0:07:54.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciple
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.56,0:07:55.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,obeys...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.48,0:07:59.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:01.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,without the demon seed
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.60,0:08:02.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,you would have won.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.12,0:08:03.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not bad !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.04,0:08:06.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,The position of Violet Son of Tian Yun is vacant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.28,0:08:08.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your Master
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.52,0:08:10.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,has high hopes for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:15.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Juniors of the Violet Division just caused a ruckus,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.44,0:08:16.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,and ruined the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.00,0:08:18.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hope everyone will forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:19.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:23.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,my Senior Brother the All-Seer will give a lecture on the Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.44,0:08:25.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hope everyone will benefit from it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.76,0:08:27.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,and make this event worth your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.88,0:08:34.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that ghost was an Ancient Demon,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:37.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,it gave me the same feeling as an Ancient God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:39.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,What was that spell ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:40.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Seventh Brother !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.08,0:08:44.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems the title Son of Tian Yun is within your grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.20,0:08:47.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me toast to your success in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.76,0:08:50.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the Teleportation spell I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:52.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,I originally planned to give it to you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.28,0:08:53.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,after Master's birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.24,0:08:56.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Besides the Teleportation Spell, this jade slip
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:08:58.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,also contains a Forbidden Spell created by Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.32,0:09:00.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I give them both to you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.92,0:09:03.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,as an apology for what happened a month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.24,0:09:04.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Young friend !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:05.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,The younger generation is formidable !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:06.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:07.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's toast to your success !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:10.32,Pavilion,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\pos(941,713)}Purple Forest Pavilion
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:33.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Teleportation spell is very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:35.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I crossed 10 000 li
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:36.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:42.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Forbidden Spell recorded in the jade slip,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.84,0:09:44.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Nine Cycles Celestial Refining Tactic,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.72,0:09:46.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,is used to transform celestial spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:48.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,into golden celestial spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.32,0:09:50.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I painstakingly circulated it for 5 hours
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:52.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I'm only at the third cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.08,0:09:55.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, the two types of celestial spiritual energy are incompatible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.88,0:09:58.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will store it in my left hand for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.32,0:10:02.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The day of the lecture
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.20,0:10:04.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,has finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.80,0:10:14.00,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1604,471)}Main Palace of the\NHeavenly Fate Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.12,0:10:34.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I heard the Violet Division is the weakest
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.64,0:10:35.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,and lacks talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:37.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:39.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Keep your voice down !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.76,0:10:40.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:52.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Late stage Soul Transformation...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.20,0:10:54.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Peak Late stage Soul Transformation...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.72,0:10:58.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Half-step Ascendant ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:11:01.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,On planet Tian Yun, just the disciples
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:03.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,of any single division
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.36,0:11:05.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,could sweep planet Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:28.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,We pay respects to the All-Seer !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:28.40,Third,,0,0,0,,We pay respects to Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:40.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am the All-Seer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.96,0:11:42.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I cultivated for tens of thousands of years
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.80,0:11:45.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,and glimpsed at the Dao of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:46.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,In this lecture on the Dao,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.92,0:11:52.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wish to share my cultivation insights with you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.48,0:12:00.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you to send an avatar,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.40,0:12:02.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.12,0:12:08.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could I not come
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:12.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,to your once in 10 000 years birthday !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.00,0:12:16.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,This little weasel...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.20,0:12:17.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I arrived in a hurry
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.60,0:12:19.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,so couldn't prepare any good gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.28,0:12:21.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I know you like things with seven colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:21.00,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1611,477)}Sun Zhongan\NEnvoy of the Cultivation Alliance
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.44,0:12:23.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,This sword is an upper middle grade celestial artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.44,0:12:24.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Its golden color
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:26.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,should suit your taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.24,0:12:31.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kunpeng Zi,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.60,0:12:34.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,your cultivation has made great progress lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.68,0:12:36.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I bestow this sword to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.48,0:12:38.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.40,0:12:42.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your attitude
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:44.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,still hasn't changed !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.32,0:12:46.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a Star-Marked Weasel,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:49.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,a pet that loves Ancient Gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.72,0:12:54.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it have sensed the faint Ancient God aura on me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.28,0:12:59.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Dao of Heavenly Fate
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:01.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,is infinitely profound.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.08,0:13:04.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivators,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.60,0:13:06.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you have doubts, please ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.92,0:13:10.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Heaveny Art
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:12.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,is about seeing the 99 cycles as one origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.92,0:13:14.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first step
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.12,0:13:16.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,from Qi Condensation
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.48,0:13:18.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,all the way to Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.04,0:13:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,is cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.40,0:13:23.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second step
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.68,0:13:25.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,from Illusory Yin and Corporeal Yang
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.96,0:13:27.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,to the 3 stages of Nirvana Shattering
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.52,0:13:33.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the transition between cultivation and the Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.80,0:13:35.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the third step
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.40,0:13:37.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the true essence of the Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:40.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sadly, even I haven't comprehended it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:43.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Dao of Heavenly Fate is:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.60,0:13:44.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,if that if you are fated,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.92,0:13:46.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can achieve anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.28,0:13:48.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if you are not fated,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.40,0:13:50.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,10 000 years of cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.16,0:13:53.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,will not amount to anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.76,0:13:57.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,If what the All-Seer says is true
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:14:00.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,then I haven't even finished the first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.36,0:14:03.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,But does the third step
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.96,0:14:05.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,even exist ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.52,0:14:10.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.16,0:14:13.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you have any questions ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:14.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.12,0:14:16.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,disciple indeed has a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.80,0:14:17.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Speak up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.92,0:14:19.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,On the path of cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:21.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have heard of 3 terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.60,0:14:22.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cultivating immortality,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.60,0:14:23.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,cultivating truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.32,0:14:24.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,cultivating the Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.60,0:14:26.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why does Master only refer to it as cultivating the Dao
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.80,0:14:28.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,and not the others ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.64,0:14:30.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,A good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.72,0:14:32.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Celestials are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.00,0:14:35.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cultivating immortality came from the ancient celestials.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.64,0:14:40.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Realm was the holy land of cultivation back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.52,0:14:43.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hence the saying "cultivating immortality".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.40,0:14:45.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The "truth" in "cultivating truth"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.64,0:14:47.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the source of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.12,0:14:50.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,After the Celestial Realm shattered,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:52.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,cultivators were like trees without roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:55.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Homeless and drifting in the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.20,0:14:58.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's how "cultivating truth" became the core of cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.16,0:15:01.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.64,0:15:04.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,both immortality and truth are things of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:07.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,What we seek is the Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.60,0:15:09.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this kind of Dao
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.16,0:15:12.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,is not the Dao of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.57,0:15:16.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can you cultivate the Dao but not follow the Dao of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:17.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then what is the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.20,0:15:21.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,The "Dao" in "cultivating the Dao"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:22.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,is a path, a direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.12,0:15:26.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because we don't know what the third step is,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.68,0:15:30.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,we are looking for a path to reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.20,0:15:31.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,This
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:35.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,is what the "Dao" in "cultivating the Dao" means.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.24,0:15:37.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.40,0:15:39.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,does that answer your question ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.40,0:15:41.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciple wonders
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.72,0:15:43.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,if the third step even exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.24,0:15:47.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,30 000 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.40,0:15:49.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I met a person
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.60,0:15:52.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,who had already reached the third step.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:55.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, he only appeared for a short time
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.20,0:15:58.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,and then disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:03.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.00,0:16:05.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,disciple also has a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.48,0:16:11.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.56,0:16:12.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,disciple has a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.64,0:16:18.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,000)\pos(1642,482)}3 days later
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.88,0:16:20.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is everyone satisfied
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.28,0:16:23.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,after these 3 days of lecture ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.40,0:16:31.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Old man All-Seer,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.84,0:16:35.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,how could I not come to your birthday !?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:40.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's Sword Saint Ling Tianhou !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.48,0:16:41.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's Ling Tianhou !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:42.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's him !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:43.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why did he come ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.40,0:16:44.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why is Ling Tianhou here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.08,0:16:46.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciples,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.52,0:16:49.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,come pay respects to Senior All-Seer !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:55.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Old man All-Seer,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.00,0:16:56.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.20,0:16:58.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,why aren't you welcoming me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.20,0:17:01.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could I not ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.64,0:17:05.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was just preparing to demonstrate a middle grade celestial spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:06.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.88,0:17:09.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,have come at the right time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.12,0:17:12.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.44,0:17:15.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will target you with this celestial spell
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.32,0:17:19.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,and let everyone present observe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.64,0:17:20.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you think ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.24,0:17:24.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why not ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.16,0:17:27.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivators,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.28,0:17:31.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is the middle grade Celestial Guidance Spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:33.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was used by ancient celestials
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.08,0:17:36.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,to send cultivators like us to the Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.20,0:17:38.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.72,0:17:40.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,pay close attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:43.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.84,0:17:44.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,open !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.92,0:18:03.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,This spell...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.92,0:18:07.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's disrupting my celestial spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:11.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Somehow the golden celestial spiritual energy is not affected !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.60,0:18:18.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Guidance !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.08,0:18:28.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,All-Seer,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:29.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.28,0:18:49.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am the Celestial Realm's Eternal Envoy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:53.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am here to guide you cultivators from lower realms.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.04,0:19:08.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Old man All-Seer...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.08,0:19:10.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Realm is no more !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.32,0:19:12.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where did your Celestial Guidance Spell
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:15.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,send all my disciples !?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:18.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sword Saint, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.00,0:19:22.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,They will return here in 3 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.92,0:19:26.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,At that time, I will need to borrow a few of your disciples
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.12,0:19:30.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,to ask them what they saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.04,0:19:34.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qilin,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.52,0:19:36.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,come back !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.60,0:19:40.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Old man All-Seer,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:42.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,3 months from now
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.48,0:19:44.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,bring the people you have chosen
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.52,0:19:46.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,to the East Demon Spirit Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:50.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have one more thing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.48,0:19:52.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I want everyone to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.88,0:19:56.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Among my 7 divisions of the Heavenly Fate Sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:58.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Yellow and Violet divisions
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.68,0:20:01.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,still don't have Sons of Tian Yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.60,0:20:04.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.00,0:20:07.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the day of the competition
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:11.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,for the Seven Sons of Tian Yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.60,0:20:13.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you all
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.76,0:20:17.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,ready to begin ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.36,0:20:33.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}I've been walking this path for endless years
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.66,0:20:33.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.64,0:20:38.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is it the compass of fate
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.48,0:20:38.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that wrote this outcome for us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.76,0:20:44.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}The heavens want to erase your existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.64,0:20:50.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that's the obsession guiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.52,0:20:55.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is this the path to uncover
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.40,0:20:55.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}truths from falsehoods ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.12,0:21:01.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}In a world of murk and shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.02,0:21:01.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}only the flame of truth can light the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.48,0:21:07.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.36,0:21:07.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}being carried by the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.60,0:21:11.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.76,0:21:11.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}being drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.88,0:21:15.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.16,0:21:18.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I will let the world refine my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.33,0:21:23.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.02,0:21:23.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}I will fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.76,0:21:26.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}I'll break through the abyss of despair
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.88,0:21:29.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}to finally learn who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.92,0:21:35.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.80,0:21:35.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I embrace this obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.28,0:21:38.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.24,0:21:41.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)}Even if this suffering shatters my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.04,0:21:46.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,700)}and I'm reborn countless times in hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.08,0:21:46.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,700)}I'll still fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.72,0:21:49.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}It's hard to avoid loneliness
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.88,0:21:52.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}when you are above everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.92,0:21:58.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.24,0:21:58.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}be afraid of a firefly ?
